From: aeronexus <aeronexus@local>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:51:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] onprem: tolerate unknown RC state keys, M3M rgb video type,
 dedupe video list

- StateRouter: drop state messages with keys the SDK does not model
  (wpmz_version, is_cloud_control_auth, camera_watermark_settings, ...)
  with one WARN per key instead of failing the integration flow
- VideoTypeEnum: rgb (Mavic 3M RGB camera)
- live capacity: M3M sends 5 identical multi-spectral-0 entries, keep one
---
 .../cloudapi/livestream/VideoTypeEnum.java    |  4 ++-
 .../com/dji/sdk/mqtt/state/StateRouter.java   | 27 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../impl/CapacityCameraServiceImpl.java       | 11 ++++++++
 3 files changed, 41 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/cloud-sdk/src/main/java/com/dji/sdk/cloudapi/livestream/VideoTypeEnum.java b/cloud-sdk/src/main/java/com/dji/sdk/cloudapi/livestream/VideoTypeEnum.java
